      "comment": "PAW HAZELTON (2) missed the frame two back but wound up strongly last time, finishing on late when second (25.62) in a Grade 5 at this track. Strong form has emerged from his last run. Deserves serious consideration. PAW NILBERT (1) goes very well this trip starting eight times for three wins and three minors. Was out of placings last time (30.84) at The Meadows in a Grade 5, finishing fourth and beaten 7 lengths. Looks a key chance on best figures. FULL BORE DONNY (8) turned in a fair 4th placed finish last time at this track over 450m (25.56). Yet to win here but has run some good races. The form out of his last race has been franked. Has ability and can measure up. DREAM ON JUNIOR (7) took charge early and was never headed last time out. Hard to beat.",
